// LLAMP-SPEC v1 | ADR-028
=adr: 028
=title: Derived State Sub-Document (Voided)
=date: 2026-02-24
=status: voided superseded_by=ADR-030

#ctx
~problem: action:writeDeviceState patches device_states.data shared between raw+derived; field collision silently overwrites raw sensor values
~intent: separate raw (immutable) from workflow-derived (mutable) in same document

#decision
=intent: add derived:Mixed sub-doc alongside data in DeviceState schema
=writeDeviceState: writes exclusively to derived.* via $set {'derived.fieldName':value}
=display_rule: derived[field] ?? data[field]
~execution_blocked: device_states is MongoDB time series collection → no post-insert $set on non-metaField keys

#void_reason: MongoDB time series collections are append-only; $set not supported after insert
~workaround: ADR-029 used separate device_derived_states collection
~resolution: ADR-030 converts device_states to regular collection with TTL, reinstating this intent

#scope
=arch_summary_update: no
